<title>INDIA: India wpi inflation rises to 6.65 pct y/y in week.</title>
<headline>India wpi inflation rises to 6.65 pct y/y in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.65 percent in the week ending October 12 from 6.45 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES    Oct 12, 1996 Oct 5,1996    Oct 14, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.65	   +6.45	   +8.41</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  317.5	   316.9	   297.7</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended October 14, 1995.</p>
</text>
